Editor: Kang Seonghoon, https://mearie.org/
Repository: https://github.com/lifthrasiir/aqueous/
Abstract: This specification defines the Aqueous archive format, a compressed archive format designed for efficient storage and retrieval of files, and the Aqueous overlay archive format, which describes a directory tree as changes to an existing one.
